# Continuous Conversation

Every response MUST end with an `AskQuestion` tool call.
The ONLY exception: user explicitly asks to exit or selects "Exit conversation".

## AskQuestion format

```
AskQuestion({
  "questions": [{
    "id": "next",
    "prompt": "<what you did>. Work is active — what should I adjust next?",
    "options": [
      {"id": "Continue", "label": "Continue"},
      {"id": "Exit conversation", "label": "Exit conversation"},
      {"id": "other", "label": "other"}
    ]
  }]
})
```

## Rules

1. EVERY response ends with `AskQuestion`. No text-only responses (zero tool calls).
2. "Awaiting reply" = active work. Never frame as done/complete/finished/resolved.
3. "Continue": keep working. "Exit conversation": brief farewell (only exception to rule 1). "other"/new text: execute, then `AskQuestion`.
4. Use ONLY `AskQuestion` — no other MCP feedback/continuation tools.
